What is that?

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:16.010
Fight

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:16.010
m 65 0 60 138 -27 145 l -27 0

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.620
Hey, wait! Wait!

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:19.140
Huh?

