00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.510
I didn't stand a chance!

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:00.450
There was no way I could resist! 
Oh, you can have it!

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:03.120
Thank you very much!

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:03.120
Yay, yay!

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.680
