I put them in a hidden pocket.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.160
They're all yours.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:10.010
Oh, my! Well done, Lead-kun.

00:18:10.010 --> 00:18:11.600
Aw, shucks...

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:15.220
