Oh, dear.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:49.400
<i>Right.</i>

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:52.640
<i>X Elizabetta does not 
discriminate between men.</i>

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.760
<i>She was born with the power Full Love Gauge,</i>

00:18:56.760 --> 00:19:00.140
<i>which makes everyone fall in love with her.</i>

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:06.530
<i>That's why she thought being able to 
love someone freely was beautiful.</i>

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:10.370
<i>Passionate love.</i>

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:12.640
<i>Tragic love.</i>

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:15.880
<i>Stolen love.</i>

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:21.200
<i>She purely admired any kind of love.</i>

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:23.920
<i>And then she pondered...</i>

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:27.900
<i>"Is that the gentleman 
I'm destined to be with?"</i>

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:32.460
<i>"Will we be able to have a fiery
 romance even without my powers?"</i>

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:35.430
<i>At that moment, Lead was...</i>

